<title>HONG KONG: Le Saunda interim net rises 103 percent.</title>
<headline>Le Saunda interim net rises 103 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended August 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.1    vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    22.67  vs 11.14</p>
<p>    Turnover		     324.95 vs 321.27</p>
<p>    Company name		 Le Saunda Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 25-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 2</p>
<p>NOTE - Le Saunda is a shoe retailer.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
